When you create a chart, Helm generates this standard structure:

my-chart/
├── Chart.yaml          # Metadata: chart name, version (SemVer), description
├── values.yaml         # Default input values passed to the templates
├── charts/             # Subcharts and dependencies (e.g., Redis, PostgreSQL)
└── templates/          # Dynamic Kubernetes manifests
    ├── deployment.yaml # Templated Deployment
    ├── service.yaml    # Templated Service
    ├── ingress.yaml    # Templated Ingress
    ├── _helpers.tpl    # Reusable Go template functions and label definitions
    └── NOTES.txt       # Instructions printed to the terminal after installation
